  "metadata": {
    "brief": {
      "text": "The Idea detail page of It's a Date per spec 8.4 and 8.6 for 'Golden-hour viewpoint drive': photo with save heart and count, title, tags, meta, rating summary, description, 'Your rating' input, and places near me (list, static OSM map, 3/5/10 km), plus a States board.",
      "answers": {
        "purpose": "Explaining a product or service",
        "theme": "Light",
        "density": "A multi-section site page"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "Light theme only (spec section 4)",
        "Logged in as Maya Chen on the main view, who has saved this idea and rated it 4; logged-out variant on the States board",
        "Places shown after the search ran, near the Mission in San Francisco; the before-search panel is on the States board",
        "The map is a static drawn panel with OSM attribution, no real tiles (Leaflet comes in Phase 6)",
        "Idea values follow content.md (idea 5: $ · Half day, 4.7 from 89 ratings, Sam Okafor)",
        "Card and header markup copied from home.html so the screens match"
      ]
    },
